Why AGPL-3.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AuraLink is an iOS port of OpenCfMoto (https://github.com/zanderp/open-cfmoto),
which is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later. The Carbit EasyConnect / PXC protocol
implementation in this app (framing, handshake sequence, cmd IDs, video pipeline
tuning constants) is a direct derivative of OpenCfMoto's reverse-engineering
work and Kotlin source. Under the terms of the AGPL, this derivative work must
also be distributed under AGPL-3.0-or-later, and anyone who redistributes
AuraLink (or runs a modified version as a network-accessible service) must make
the complete corresponding source available under the same license and preserve
the copyright and attribution notices below.

